<dc:date>2026-10-15</dc:date>
<dc:title>Volume keep with previous, one-sheet chapters test</dc:title>
<dc:description>Seven chapters with break-before=&quot;sheet&quot; and keep-with-previous-sheets=&quot;1&quot;, each fitting on one sheet. Chapter 3 starts with a sheet without content rows, so the book has 8 sheets. A chapter that fits on one sheet has nothing to keep, so the volumes are 4 and 4 sheets.</dc:description>
</meta>
